    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Madden are delighted to bring to the market this most attractive three bed detached residence.\n82 Baunoge is located on a cul-de-sac within a quiet residential development with easy reach of Loughrea town centre and all it's social and recreational amenities and is also within walking distance of both primary and secondary schools.\n\nBoasting bright and spacious accommodation, one has the opportunity here to acquire an excellent quality energy efficient home in a most convenient location.Viewing is highly recommended and can be arranged through selling agents."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 3.45m x 1.90m\nFront aspect window and door, tile flooring\n\nSitting Room - 3.94m x 4.35m\nFront aspect window, soild fuel insert stove, wooden flooring\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 2.32m x 6.38m\nRear aspect window and French doors leading to patio area with overhead pergola, fitted wall and base units, solid fuel stove, tile flooring\n\nGroundfloor w/c - 1.99m x 1.48m\nSide aspect window, whb/wc, tile flooring\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 1.84m x 3.80m\nSide access window, stira stairs to attic, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.40m x 4.36m\nFront aspect sliding door leading to balcony, wooden flooring - En-Suite: 1.54m x 1.92m - Front aspect window, whb/wc/shower, tiled flooring\n\nBathroom - 1.85m x 2.47m\nSide aspect window, whb/wc/bath with overhead shower, tiled flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.52m x 3.58m\nRear aspect window, wooden flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.52m x 2.67m\nRear aspect window, wooden flooring\n\nGarden - \nPaved driveway, mature trees, side access to rear garden, patio area with pergola, grass and gravel with planting, wall boundary\n\n"
      },
      {
